{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towers of Scale is an optimization resource management puzzle game under a guise of an RPG.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 15 unique stages with increasing complexity, with more to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources - keys, pickaxes, gold, held items, one way pathways and even the remaining enemies - to reach the crown with as high power as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The optimal routes are ever-evolving - by getting new personal best scores you obtain gems, which you can use on extra resources and accessing bonus areas. This will give you new possibilities to push your scores even higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Want to experiment? Infinite undo queue and savestates come to the rescue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the colorblind-friendly pixel art graphics that will be handled well even by potato computers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962750?t=1763826154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962750?t=1763826154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962750/3b6e6b5e65d4e462709d6450ba9687d7da82b2be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763826154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962750/3b6e6b5e65d4e462709d6450ba9687d7da82b2be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763826154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3964250,"descri